Package: freedomnas-profiles
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: freedomnas-core
Description: FreedomNAS OS Profiles — JSON Translator Layer
 Contains OS-specific command profiles (JSON) for:
  • Debian (with package managers, systemd, etc.)
  • FreeBSD (with pkg, rc.conf, etc.)
  • Arch Linux (with pacman, systemd, etc.)
 .
 These profiles abstract OS-specific commands so FreedomNAS Core can
 provision storage appliances universally across different OSes.
